On my U2004 VM, with an armhf cross compiler installed -

/home/dbannon/bin/FPC/fpc-3.2.3/bin/fpc  -Parm -CpARMV7 -MObjFPC -Scghi -O3 -gt -l -vewnhibq -Fu. -owebserver-armhf webserver.pas

On my LT, no cross compiling

/home/dbannon/bin/FPC/fpc-3.2.4/bin/fpc  -MObjFPC -Scghi -O3 -gt -l -vewnhibq -Fu. -owebserver webserver.pas

-S... compile options (c ops, goto, ansistrings, inlining
-v... usual verbose options
-XX   smart linking
-Xs   strip
-gt   trash vars 

